+// [3a] Streaming VTK XML ImageData writer. No VTK C++ dependency; link zlib.
+// Uses VTK's raw appended zlib block layout with UInt64 headers/offsets.
+// The 64-KiB payload buffer bounds extra RAM; no full output-array copy is made.
+// These are visualization files. Float32 conversion is optional and occurs ONLY
